      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nFixes #46721.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a conservative `num_stages=1` fallback for large MLA decode attention tiles on NVIDIA.\r\n\r\nThe reported failure happens in `_fwd_grouped_kernel_stage1` with:\r\n\r\n```text\r\ntriton.runtime.errors.OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 102400, Hardware limit: 101376.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe existing NVIDIA fallback only handles `BLOCK_DMODEL >= 1024`, but the MLA path with `Lk=576` uses `BLOCK_DMODEL=512` and `BLOCK_DPE=64`, so it does not hit the existing fallback. This change keeps the existing block sizes and only reduces `num_stages` for large MLA decode tiles, which should reduce shared memory usage while keeping the fix minimal.\r\n\r\nI checked for duplicate work before opening this PR:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ngh issue view 46721 --repo vllm-project/vllm --comments\r\ngh pr list --repo vllm-project/vllm --state open --search \"46721 in:body\"\r\ngh pr list --repo vllm-project/vllm --state open --search \"MLA decode shared memory\"\r\ngh pr list --repo vllm-project/vllm --state open --search \"triton_decode_attention num_stages\"\r\ngh pr list --repo vllm-project/vllm --state open --search \"OutOfResources shared memory MLA\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nResults:\r\n\r\n* No open PR directly references #46721.\r\n* No open PR matched `triton_decode_attention num_stages`.\r\n* Broader searches returned some related MLA/shared-memory/FP8 PRs, but I did not find an open PR that applies this specific minimal `num_stages=1` fallback for the Triton MLA decode path reported in #46721.\r\n\r\nAI assistance was used while investigating the issue, reasoning about the Triton shared-memory fallback. I reviewed the changed code and test results before submitting.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\nRun the most relevant Triton decode attention and MLA backend tests:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest -s -v tests/kernels/attention/test_triton_decode_attention.py\r\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest -s -v tests/v1/attention/test_mla_backends.py\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\nPassed:\r\n\r\n```text\r\ntests/kernels/attention/test_triton_decode_attention.py: all tests(115) passed\r\ntests/v1/attention/test_mla_backends.py: all tests passed\r\n```\r\n\r\nNot fully validated locally:\r\n\r\nI do not have access to the original Kimi K2.7 INT4 + FP8 KV cache + 8x RTX 6000 Pro setup from the issue report, so this PR is opened as a draft and needs validation from the issue reporter or maintainers on the original failing setup.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
